<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.920" end="00:00:13.440" style="s2">I reject you as my mate. Then fate chose wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.440" end="00:00:18.640" style="s2">Let me see your arm.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.640" end="00:00:27.200" style="s2">Hide this. Say you never saw me. Packed <br />medicine is for real wolves, not wolfless trash.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.880" end="00:00:36.080" style="s2">Confess you stole healing herbs before <br />the moonlight. No, she was only I took  </p>
<p begin="00:00:36.080" end="00:00:50.400" style="s2">the herbs. She had nothing to do with it. Good. <br />A thief should clean before she begs the moon.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.400" end="00:00:54.480" style="s2">Careful, Serena. Even the moon can <br />smell desperation. Then it already  </p>
<p begin="00:00:54.480" end="00:01:04.160" style="s2">knows this place is rotten. Let <br />the moon reveal its chosen mates.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.160" end="00:01:10.160" style="s2">No, that can&#39;t be mine.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.160" end="00:01:15.680" style="s2">The alpha&#39;s mate is the wolfless Omega.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.680" end="00:01:23.280" style="s2">I didn&#39;t ask the moon for this. <br />Then the moon made a mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.280" end="00:01:39.120" style="s2">I reject you as my mate. Then fate chose wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.120" end="00:01:43.520" style="s2">Serena, don&#39;t touch her. The whole <br />pack is watching. She still thinks  </p>
<p begin="00:01:43.520" end="00:01:50.960" style="s2">the bond means something. So that&#39;s your answer.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.960" end="00:01:55.600" style="s2">The moon shard is gone. Only one <br />servant touched the shrine before  </p>
<p begin="00:01:55.600" end="00:02:03.680" style="s2">the ceremony. The sacred relic in the I <br />saw her hide that bag behind the altar.  </p>
<p begin="00:02:03.680" end="00:02:14.080" style="s2">You planted this. She&#39;s desperate. <br />She wanted the bond to save her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.080" end="00:02:24.000" style="s2">Liars bleed silver, too. I was burned trying <br />to protect the shard. You touched the shroud.  </p>
<p begin="00:02:24.000" end="00:02:37.920" style="s2">Enough. The thief now attacks our future Luna. <br />She touched it. Look at her hand. Say you saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.920" end="00:02:42.240" style="s2">I can&#39;t save you from this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.240" end="00:02:49.280" style="s2">Serena Vale is guilty of theft and <br />assault. At dawn, she leaves Silver Creek.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.720" end="00:03:04.880" style="s2">Try not to die before sunrise. Open the gate. <br />You didn&#39;t reject me. You buried me. She&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="00:03:04.880" end="00:03:16.400" style="s2">still trying to curse you. Cross the border. <br />Don&#39;t come back. Keep walking. Don&#39;t fall.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.760" end="00:03:27.040" style="s2">Meera said the thief wouldn&#39;t get far.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.040" end="00:03:31.600" style="s2">Tell Meera I&#39;m still standing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.600" end="00:03:35.200" style="s2">Confess you stole the shard and this ends clean. I  </p>
<p begin="00:03:35.200" end="00:03:42.000" style="s2">won&#39;t die inside your lie. <br />Then die outside the pack.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.520" end="00:03:53.280" style="s2">Touch her again. Lose the hand. <br />She&#39;s Silver Creek trash. Black  </p>
<p begin="00:03:53.280" end="00:03:56.640" style="s2">Ridge protects the one Silver <br />Creek hunt. I don&#39;t belong to  </p>
<p begin="00:03:56.640" end="00:04:08.000" style="s2">anyone. Good. I hate easy claims. What <br />are you staring at? He exiled a queen.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.000" end="00:04:10.880" style="s2">Don&#39;t touch me. You&#39;re bleeding through the snow.  </p>
<p begin="00:04:12.240" end="00:04:19.600" style="s2">I don&#39;t belong to you. Good. <br />I don&#39;t collect trophies.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.600" end="00:04:31.520" style="s2">You don&#39;t know what she is. Who sent you? Silver <br />Creek cleans its own mistakes. Wrong answer.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.520" end="00:04:36.720" style="s2">Move. Survive tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.720" end="00:04:39.120" style="s2">Ruin them tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.960" end="00:04:53.120" style="s2">You&#39;re freezing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.120" end="00:05:06.800" style="s2">Don&#39;t mistake weakness for <br />permission. Still biting. Good.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.800" end="00:05:18.240" style="s2">What are you doing? This isn&#39;t a pack <br />mark. This mark should not exist.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.240" end="00:05:30.960" style="s2">I&#39;m not staying here. Then look outside first.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.960" end="00:05:38.000" style="s2">Step out now. They drag you back in chains.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.000" end="00:05:42.560" style="s2">This reaction is wrong. Wrong <br />how? Her wolf isn&#39;t answering,  </p>
<p begin="00:05:42.560" end="00:05:52.000" style="s2">but it&#39;s there. I don&#39;t have a wolf. Maybe <br />someone wanted you to believe that. You want  </p>
<p begin="00:05:52.000" end="00:05:59.600" style="s2">a war with Silver Creek. I&#39;m your excuse. I&#39;m <br />not your savior, but I&#39;m not your cage. Die  </p>
<p begin="00:05:59.600" end="00:06:14.240" style="s2">outside or heal and find proof. I stay to clear <br />my name, not to serve Black Ridge. Move, Alpha.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.240" end="00:06:23.680" style="s2">Don&#39;t block me. Breathe first. Hate me later. <br />Don&#39;t make kindness another cage. Kale,  </p>
<p begin="00:06:23.680" end="00:06:34.080" style="s2">you need to see this. A wolf isn&#39;t <br />gone. Something is holding it down.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.080" end="00:06:45.920" style="s2">Who can do that to a wolf? Not a healer. Not <br />like this. This looks hidden. Not healed.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.920" end="00:06:51.840" style="s2">Out now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.840" end="00:06:58.080" style="s2">I won&#39;t be someone&#39;s experiment. <br />Then control what they buried.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.080" end="00:07:04.160" style="s2">Put the pain in your palm. Pain <br />is power if you don&#39;t waste it.  </p>
<p begin="00:07:05.280" end="00:07:13.760" style="s2">Why is this working? Because you&#39;re not broken.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.760" end="00:07:17.200" style="s2">Before dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.200" end="00:07:21.920" style="s2">You should rest. She&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.920" end="00:07:26.080" style="s2">Why do you smell like the woods? <br />I was praying near the border.  </p>
<p begin="00:07:26.080" end="00:07:30.480" style="s2">Then pray harder. I&#39;m checking every name.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.480" end="00:07:48.320" style="s2">Help me catch whoever sent them. You&#39;ll <br />need more than rage. Train with me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.320" end="00:07:56.320" style="s2">Train me, but don&#39;t try to own me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.320" end="00:08:10.640" style="s2">Stay only if you choose it. Silver Creek sent us <br />a broken stray. They threw me out. Different story</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.640" end="00:08:17.520" style="s2">again. Weak wolves stay down.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.520" end="00:08:24.320" style="s2">I said I&#39;d learn, not Neil.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.320" end="00:08:28.160" style="s2">Training is not execution. <br />Let her go. She aimed for  </p>
<p begin="00:08:28.160" end="00:08:35.520" style="s2">your wound. Then I&#39;ll learn where she aims. Reset.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.520" end="00:08:47.360" style="s2">Stop calling her weak. You&#39;re teaching <br />her where to strike. Still think I&#39;m easy.</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.360" end="00:08:51.600" style="s2">Poison</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.600" end="00:08:54.960" style="s2">trust issues look good on you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.280" end="00:09:06.400" style="s2">Let them underestimate you. Then charge interest.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.400" end="00:09:18.880" style="s2">I charge double.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.880" end="00:09:23.840" style="s2">That wasn&#39;t Omega Instinct. Then what was it?  </p>
<p begin="00:09:23.840" end="00:09:35.440" style="s2">Something older. Something trained <br />into bone. Rowan needs another look.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.440" end="00:09:42.880" style="s2">This isn&#39;t Black Ridge. And it isn&#39;t <br />Silver Creek. You called me a queen.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:42.880" end="00:09:49.520" style="s2">I said he exiled one. Don&#39;t crown me <br />to control me. Then earn the crown  </p>
<p begin="00:09:49.520" end="00:09:57.920" style="s2">yourself. The records are missing. <br />Someone removed the old bloodlines.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.920" end="00:10:04.880" style="s2">So I&#39;m not just cursed. You&#39;re <br />hidden. That&#39;s worse. First mirror,  </p>
<p begin="00:10:04.880" end="00:10:10.000" style="s2">then this mark. You want evidence. I want the next  </p>
<p begin="00:10:10.000" end="00:10:20.160" style="s2">witness alive. Alpha Kale report. The <br />hunter is dead. Someone silenced him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.000" end="00:10:26.640" style="s2">Then we find who got to him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.640" end="00:10:34.400" style="s2">Take me to the body. Every step you take can <br />start a border fight. Regretting the trouble  </p>
<p begin="00:10:34.400" end="00:10:45.040" style="s2">you dragged in. Protection still feels <br />like a leash. Then wear it like armor.</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.040" end="00:10:59.360" style="s2">Your search, your call. Silver Creek signal <br />paper. It burned after the door opened.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.360" end="00:11:04.080" style="s2">We risk war for a Silver Creek exile now. <br />Your killer walked in after he died. Or she  </p>
<p begin="00:11:04.080" end="00:11:13.120" style="s2">brought Silver Creek poison with her. Let <br />him doubt me. Doubt keeps people looking.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.320" end="00:11:23.760" style="s2">That&#39;s Mera&#39;s family crest. <br />Half a charm proves nothing. No,  </p>
<p begin="00:11:23.760" end="00:11:27.680" style="s2">but the burnt trail of someone came from <br />inside. Seal the West Hall. She leads the  </p>
<p begin="00:11:27.680" end="00:11:36.480" style="s2">search. You&#39;re giving her command. I&#39;m giving <br />her room to prove you wrong. Meera was here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.480" end="00:11:42.320" style="s2">I&#39;m taking this to Silver Creek with half a <br />charm. It has her crest. Mirror will call it  </p>
<p begin="00:11:42.320" end="00:11:52.160" style="s2">planted before you finish speaking. And <br />Silver Creek will call this an invasion.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.160" end="00:11:57.200" style="s2">There. Someone wanted us to see Blclo. <br />That cloak is too clean. No snow,  </p>
<p begin="00:11:57.200" end="00:12:03.840" style="s2">no blood. A ghost in our own halls. She <br />arrives and we get poison, dead prisoners,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:03.840" end="00:12:15.520" style="s2">fake cloaks. Say it straight. Hand her over. Buy <br />peace before she costs us a war. Careful, Darius.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.520" end="00:12:22.480" style="s2">No, we make them come back. You want to <br />bait the killer? Spread that I found the  </p>
<p begin="00:12:22.480" end="00:12:29.680" style="s2">full proof. Whoever killed him will panic. No, <br />you&#39;re not bait. You trust me until I move.  </p>
<p begin="00:12:29.680" end="00:12:38.320" style="s2">I trust you. I don&#39;t trust traps. Then <br />stop guarding the cage. Guard the door.  </p>
<p begin="00:12:38.320" end="00:12:46.720" style="s2">I stay close. No arguments. <br />That sounds nothing like trust.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.720" end="00:12:53.360" style="s2">Fine. We bait the killer with <br />you. If Meera wants proof gone,  </p>
<p begin="00:12:53.360" end="00:12:58.240" style="s2">she knows where to find me. I&#39;m here <br />if you fall. Then watch me stand. The  </p>
<p begin="00:12:58.240" end="00:13:04.080" style="s2">full evidence is safer with me than in <br />your vault. Too much alpha scent and he  </p>
<p begin="00:13:04.080" end="00:13:14.320" style="s2">runs. You enjoy making this difficult. You <br />shouldn&#39;t train alone. I enjoy surviving.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.320" end="00:13:18.160" style="s2">Too slow.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.160" end="00:13:25.440" style="s2">You&#39;re already dead. Not before you talk.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.640" end="00:13:35.840" style="s2">Bitter root.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.840" end="00:13:46.560" style="s2">You know that smell? Elias used it on my wounds.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.560" end="00:13:52.560" style="s2">Old and firmary clay. Silver Creek <br />border. Your call. Mirror&#39;s people  </p>
<p begin="00:13:52.560" end="00:14:01.120" style="s2">are meeting there. Then I follow <br />your lead. I&#39;m going for Elias.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.120" end="00:14:11.360" style="s2">By sunrise, the old doctor burns.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.360" end="00:14:18.560" style="s2">That&#39;s Elias. Wait, let them speak first. <br />What is the mark on Serena&#39;s shoulder?  </p>
<p begin="00:14:18.560" end="00:14:25.680" style="s2">They came for my mark. Tell us about the <br />baby they brought to Silver Creek. Baby,  </p>
<p begin="00:14:25.680" end="00:14:35.200" style="s2">I won&#39;t give Malik another child. The birth <br />record was changed. Where is the real one?</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.200" end="00:14:42.320" style="s2">Step away from him. Wrong door. Little Moon,  </p>
<p begin="00:14:42.320" end="00:14:50.240" style="s2">you survived. Who made me disappear? Not <br />your parents. The elders. He&#39;s poisoned.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.120" end="00:15:05.040" style="s2">Who brought me to Silver Creek? <br />Councilmen. Sealed orders. No names.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.040" end="00:15:10.480" style="s2">We leave together or we die here. <br />Then don&#39;t slow down. Serena,  </p>
<p begin="00:15:10.480" end="00:15:15.520" style="s2">your birth record is still inside Silver Creek.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.520" end="00:15:24.320" style="s2">Elias, where inside Silver Creek? Alive. <br />Elder seal. Archive. Elder seal. Don&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="00:15:24.320" end="00:15:29.200" style="s2">trust the shrine. I&#39;m going to the archive <br />tonight. Mirror just failed to kill you.  </p>
<p begin="00:15:29.200" end="00:15:36.720" style="s2">Silver Creek is waiting. Every time you say <br />protect, you mean decide for me. If you die,  </p>
<p begin="00:15:36.720" end="00:15:46.000" style="s2">the truth gets buried with you. <br />Cold. Cold. Don&#39;t leave me outside.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.920" end="00:15:55.200" style="s2">sleep. I&#39;ll watch the door.</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.200" end="00:16:00.560" style="s2">You stayed. You ordered me not to <br />promise. I didn&#39;t. Tomorrow night,  </p>
<p begin="00:16:00.560" end="00:16:08.080" style="s2">the archive. I go in with you. That <br />wasn&#39;t the deal. New deal. You don&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="00:16:08.080" end="00:16:14.480" style="s2">walk into a trap alone. I know have <br />them fate, Jonas, that me broest.  </p>
<p begin="00:16:15.520" end="00:16:29.440" style="s2">Fine, but I lead. Wait, the file is under <br />another name. Two guards. West turn in 5 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.440" end="00:16:33.280" style="s2">I go in alone.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.280" end="00:16:43.360" style="s2">That room is built to trap thieves. Then <br />it finally meets the girl they stole from.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.360" end="00:16:53.920" style="s2">Archive. Elder Seal. Another name.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.920" end="00:17:00.480" style="s2">No, they didn&#39;t lose me. They erased <br />me. Patrols are moving. What did you  </p>
<p begin="00:17:00.480" end="00:17:09.840" style="s2">find? A life scraped clean. Elder wax. High <br />clearance. So they had power to erase me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.520" end="00:17:21.440" style="s2">Serena, don&#39;t hide her from the elders.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.440" end="00:17:26.560" style="s2">Then we make them remember that was me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.560" end="00:17:31.760" style="s2">Someone tripped the ward. I know <br />you&#39;re inside. Open the door,  </p>
<p begin="00:17:31.760" end="00:17:36.560" style="s2">Serena. Don&#39;t start a fight in here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.320" end="00:17:44.080" style="s2">What did he do to you? You don&#39;t get to be <br />jealous. Try yelling less. She&#39;s bleeding.  </p>
<p begin="00:17:44.080" end="00:17:52.480" style="s2">That&#39;s your file. What&#39;s left of it? The <br />elders sealed this. Good doubt later. Move  </p>
<p begin="00:17:52.480" end="00:17:58.560" style="s2">now. The archive is locked down. If they find <br />her, they execute her here. Then stop blocking  </p>
<p begin="00:17:58.560" end="00:18:08.480" style="s2">the only door. Guards shout above them. <br />Who&#39;s there? Don&#39;t breathe. The rejected  </p>
<p begin="00:18:08.480" end="00:18:14.320" style="s2">bond burns under her skin. Your bond <br />hurts her. Mine doesn&#39;t. Both of you,  </p>
<p begin="00:18:14.320" end="00:18:32.000" style="s2">stop. Breathe. No one touches you. I said <br />stop talking. Serena, I shut up and follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.000" end="00:18:34.160" style="s2">Well, well.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.200" end="00:18:45.680" style="s2">Caught between two alphas. How embarrassing. <br />Stealing records with Black Ridge. Bold for a  </p>
<p begin="00:18:45.680" end="00:18:54.720" style="s2">thief. Still lying with witnesses present. She ran <br />to your enemy the second you rejected her. How did  </p>
<p begin="00:18:54.720" end="00:19:11.040" style="s2">you know we were here? The elders know everything. <br />That&#39;s not an answer. Take them. Serena, move.</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.040" end="00:19:17.120" style="s2">Not without an exit.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.120" end="00:19:22.160" style="s2">I found a way out. Jump.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.160" end="00:19:31.760" style="s2">Serena. Pain isn&#39;t permission. Still hurt. <br />Yes, but it doesn&#39;t get to choose for me.  </p>
<p begin="00:19:33.680" end="00:19:40.240" style="s2">Then let me earn a question. <br />A token doesn&#39;t fix a trial.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.240" end="00:19:47.680" style="s2">Use it. I&#39;ll look into mirror. <br />This is not forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.680" end="00:19:59.280" style="s2">Melik, I found the fragment. Tell <br />me what it is. Real moonshit.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.000" end="00:20:05.200" style="s2">It stored royal blood memory. Then <br />why was it in my file? If I say more,  </p>
<p begin="00:20:05.200" end="00:20:09.760" style="s2">the elders hunt everyone here.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.760" end="00:20:14.240" style="s2">Silence protected everyone but me. <br />No one hears beyond this room. They  </p>
<p begin="00:20:14.240" end="00:20:20.240" style="s2">brought me a baby girl. No parents, no <br />name. The order said, &quot;Register her as  </p>
<p begin="00:20:20.240" end="00:20:27.280" style="s2">a lowborn Omega.&quot; Who signed it? The Elder <br />Seal covered every name. How embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.600" end="00:20:36.320" style="s2">She&#39;s touching the real relics. Then she is <br />closer than I hoped. What if she is real?  </p>
<p begin="00:20:36.320" end="00:20:42.400" style="s2">Real doesn&#39;t matter. If the world kneels wrong <br />first, then I need the original registration. No,  </p>
<p begin="00:20:42.400" end="00:20:46.800" style="s2">that book is guarded by the council. Then we <br />learn the guards. We expose the first lie,  </p>
<p begin="00:20:46.800" end="00:20:55.520" style="s2">then the next. Let them kneel first. Truth <br />can come too late. Bleed like a queen.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.760" end="00:21:05.280" style="s2">again. Stop. You&#39;re tearing yourself <br />open. Mirror is moving faster than me.  </p>
<p begin="00:21:05.280" end="00:21:10.160" style="s2">Then stop chasing her. Control yourself <br />first. Breathe before you burn. I hate  </p>
<p begin="00:21:10.160" end="00:21:15.280" style="s2">that your voice works. There. You held <br />the pain. Maybe I&#39;m done being held.  </p>
<p begin="00:21:15.280" end="00:21:22.800" style="s2">Careful. That sounded like a challenge. <br />Am I interrupting strategy or suicide?</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.480" end="00:21:29.920" style="s2">Silver Creek calls it a moon blessing. If we <br />interfere, they&#39;ll call it war. You ask us to  </p>
<p begin="00:21:29.920" end="00:21:35.360" style="s2">gamble a pack on your missing file. I have <br />a blank file, a real shard, and hunter sent  </p>
<p begin="00:21:35.360" end="00:21:40.320" style="s2">to kill me. That&#39;s not enough for a war. I&#39;m <br />not asking you to start one. Give me one rule,  </p>
<p begin="00:21:40.320" end="00:21:48.720" style="s2">one audience, one chance to expose her. <br />And if you fail, I will fail on my feet.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.000" end="00:22:00.000" style="s2">Mera gets crowned tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.000" end="00:22:06.720" style="s2">If we wait, she wears my life as a crown. <br />We go. Small Austin. No full war gift. Or  </p>
<p begin="00:22:06.720" end="00:22:10.240" style="s2">you&#39;re afraid I burn your bargaining chim <br />too early. I am afraid you die in front of  </p>
<p begin="00:22:10.240" end="00:22:17.120" style="s2">a fake crown. So I&#39;m more than leverage <br />now. Walk in like they owe you answers.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.800" end="00:22:31.280" style="s2">Then tie it yourself. This is <br />your choice. I stand by it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.280" end="00:22:41.840" style="s2">The moon marked me when I defended its relic. <br />The lunar bled for us. You should rest your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.440" end="00:22:50.720" style="s2">She dares come back. There&#39;s the traitor <br />with her alpha. If you&#39;re blessed,  </p>
<p begin="00:22:50.720" end="00:22:57.440" style="s2">stop hiding. From what? From the truth of the <br />night you framed me. Let the moon settle this  </p>
<p begin="00:22:57.440" end="00:23:03.680" style="s2">quarrel. You want a spectacle. If she&#39;s <br />innocent, the relic will show. You wanted  </p>
<p begin="00:23:03.680" end="00:23:11.600" style="s2">the moon to speak. Then let the moon judge her. <br />It answered her. The relic rejects her. Look,  </p>
<p begin="00:23:11.600" end="00:23:22.240" style="s2">this is what happens when corrupted blood <br />touches sacred stone. Sees the witch.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.240" end="00:23:32.960" style="s2">No one touches her. Adrien Alfa, you defend a <br />thief against your elders. I defend my pack from  </p>
<p begin="00:23:32.960" end="00:23:39.040" style="s2">rushed sentences. The bond is twisting him. <br />She&#39;s using it against us. I don&#39;t need his  </p>
<p begin="00:23:39.040" end="00:23:52.960" style="s2">bond to speak. This is what the relic. Your <br />split doesn&#39;t echo. It imitates to squite.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.960" end="00:23:56.480" style="s2">Elias Reed. This exiled healer colluded with Black  </p>
<p begin="00:23:56.480" end="00:24:03.920" style="s2">Ridge to fake evidence. Serena, <br />wait. He wants you to explode.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.280" end="00:24:15.920" style="s2">Behold the witch Black Ridge brought us. Keep <br />her away from the pups. He was the one about to  </p>
<p begin="00:24:15.920" end="00:24:26.240" style="s2">be maimed. Stand down, witch. Trial first, then <br />names. Your alpha is disobeying sacred judgment.  </p>
<p begin="00:24:26.240" end="00:24:38.640" style="s2">He&#39;s risking us all for the Omega who rejected <br />our rules. He chooses her over us. Move now.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.640" end="00:24:48.240" style="s2">The shard. You can&#39;t clear your name <br />from a p. Running makes me look guilty.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.240" end="00:24:52.560" style="s2">You can&#39;t clear your name from a <br />py. Dying makes you silent. I&#39;m  </p>
<p begin="00:24:52.560" end="00:25:00.960" style="s2">tired of leaving in the middle of my <br />own story. Then finish it breathing.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.160" end="00:25:07.680" style="s2">Serena, I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.680" end="00:25:22.880" style="s2">Shard not whole. Another piece. Where? Moon. <br />Well, before Malik does. So, there&#39;s more proof.</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.880" end="00:25:26.480" style="s2">What do you want to do next? Get him safe. Then  </p>
<p begin="00:25:26.480" end="00:25:30.480" style="s2">get there first. Find the <br />Moonwell before Malik does.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.640" end="00:25:38.400" style="s2">The council just called her a <br />witch. Every patrol is watching.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.400" end="00:25:46.320" style="s2">We leave tonight. You step outside. They hunt you <br />and Black Ridge with you. Do you also think I&#39;m  </p>
<p begin="00:25:46.320" end="00:25:53.360" style="s2">dangerous? I think you&#39;re powerful. Danger <br />is what they call power they don&#39;t control.  </p>
<p begin="00:25:53.360" end="00:25:59.840" style="s2">And what do you call it? A weapon that should <br />aim itself. Push it out, then pull it back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.160" end="00:26:05.520" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.520" end="00:26:13.280" style="s2">You should have let go. <br />Don&#39;t fear the light. Aim it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.280" end="00:26:16.640" style="s2">Malik won&#39;t think I&#39;m stupid <br />enough to come here now. He  </p>
<p begin="00:26:16.640" end="00:26:23.520" style="s2">thinks you&#39;re desperate. Desperate does anything.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.520" end="00:26:28.560" style="s2">Let them underestimate one small omega. Got you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.760" end="00:26:39.840" style="s2">No. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.840" end="00:26:47.600" style="s2">If I miss, we die.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.600" end="00:26:56.400" style="s2">On your feet. I aim this time. There <br />by the well. That&#39;s how a weapon runs,  </p>
<p begin="00:26:56.400" end="00:27:04.480" style="s2">not a victim. You&#39;re still bleeding. <br />What? Did you wrestle a forge?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.480" end="00:27:08.960" style="s2">Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.960" end="00:27:16.560" style="s2">I thought you didn&#39;t do <br />kindness. I&#39;m only paying a debt.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.560" end="00:27:22.720" style="s2">Then don&#39;t stop at even numbers.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.720" end="00:27:26.240" style="s2">Any pack harboring Serena Veil will face sanction.  </p>
<p begin="00:27:27.520" end="00:27:39.600" style="s2">We can&#39;t fight every council edict. I can <br />leave. You keep your pack out of this.</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.600" end="00:27:47.360" style="s2">You think I&#39;m here because you&#39;re <br />harmless. I know I&#39;m not harmless.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.360" end="00:27:50.800" style="s2">I chose you before you were safe. That&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="00:27:50.800" end="00:27:55.440" style="s2">a terrible strategy. It&#39;s the <br />only one I&#39;m willing to play.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.600" end="00:28:05.760" style="s2">blockage. Stay behind me or prove me wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.760" end="00:28:12.960" style="s2">I need to speak with her <br />alone. That&#39;s not happening.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.960" end="00:28:19.120" style="s2">If you came with answers, say them to my <br />face. I need to speak with her alone. That&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="00:28:19.120" end="00:28:29.360" style="s2">not happening. If you came with answers, say them <br />to my face. I found something from the ceremony.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.360" end="00:28:37.360" style="s2">She went in before they ever called my name. I <br />should have believed you first. You believed me  </p>
<p begin="00:28:37.360" end="00:28:45.680" style="s2">after I bled. We&#39;re finished here. They call her <br />a witch and you still bring her to their door.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.680" end="00:28:49.280" style="s2">No one said anything when the elders <br />burned other packs. We weren&#39;t their  </p>
<p begin="00:28:49.280" end="00:28:58.480" style="s2">next target until she walked <br />in. One exile isn&#39;t worth a war.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.480" end="00:29:04.000" style="s2">Then look at why they&#39;re afraid of me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.000" end="00:29:14.320" style="s2">Clear the holes. That&#39;s the royal <br />crest. He was there. No royal child.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.280" end="00:29:24.800" style="s2">He ordered something that night. One <br />broken sentence won&#39;t win a council.  </p>
<p begin="00:29:24.800" end="00:29:27.280" style="s2">Maric will call it a Black Ridge forgery. There&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="00:29:27.280" end="00:29:35.200" style="s2">more he didn&#39;t show us. You sound like <br />you already know the rest of the story.</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.200" end="00:29:39.200" style="s2">These were my fathers.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.200" end="00:29:47.760" style="s2">You knew they touched the royal line. He <br />wrote about a purge the elders never admitted.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.760" end="00:29:55.040" style="s2">So when you saw my shoulder in the snow, <br />I thought I recognized the mark. Rumors  </p>
<p begin="00:29:55.040" end="00:30:02.320" style="s2">said one heir survived, hidden. You saw <br />a crown, not me. At first, then you made  </p>
<p begin="00:30:02.320" end="00:30:07.920" style="s2">that impossible. From the night you dragged <br />me out of the snow, you were waiting for your  </p>
<p begin="00:30:07.920" end="00:30:16.240" style="s2">prophecy. I needed someone who could break the <br />council&#39;s grip. So, I was a weapon with a pulse.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.240" end="00:30:20.640" style="s2">I&#39;m more afraid of this truth eating <br />you than I ever was excited to use it.  </p>
<p begin="00:30:20.640" end="00:30:27.840" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to rewrite while <br />you pick me up. You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.840" end="00:30:34.400" style="s2">I&#39;m done being your prophecy.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.400" end="00:30:38.560" style="s2">No alpha, no safety net.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.520" end="00:30:50.320" style="s2">You always did like the side <br />doors. This time you choose.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.320" end="00:30:57.440" style="s2">Choice doesn&#39;t erase what you did before.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.440" end="00:31:02.640" style="s2">The council burned anything with old royal ties.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.640" end="00:31:13.760" style="s2">Female infant silver mark. They brought you <br />Serena, not your parents. Don&#39;t steady me now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.760" end="00:31:19.200" style="s2">You don&#39;t get points for arriving late.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.200" end="00:31:28.720" style="s2">You going to drag me back this time? <br />Bring her down or admit you&#39;re hers. Well,</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.720" end="00:31:36.000" style="s2">lower your weapons. Adrien.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.000" end="00:31:36.960" style="s2">She leaves.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.480" end="00:31:56.720" style="s2">still standing. Council said she&#39;d <br />come alone. They&#39;re getting lazy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.720" end="00:32:04.080" style="s2">I told you not to follow <br />me. You told me I disagreed.</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.240" end="00:32:24.960" style="s2">Left high. Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.960" end="00:32:33.040" style="s2">Stop bleeding for me. I&#39;m not bleeding <br />for you. I&#39;m standing with you.  </p>
<p begin="00:32:33.760" end="00:32:51.440" style="s2">You&#39;re an idiot. Where is he? <br />The healer dies at midnight.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.440" end="00:33:01.680" style="s2">No. No. They came while we were gone. Council <br />seal. They left terms. Bring both shards. Come  </p>
<p begin="00:33:01.680" end="00:33:07.760" style="s2">alone. Bridge by midnight. You are not bait. <br />If you march an army, they get exactly the  </p>
<p begin="00:33:07.760" end="00:33:13.200" style="s2">war they want. If you go alone, they get a <br />dead air and a dead witness. You stay where  </p>
<p begin="00:33:13.200" end="00:33:16.960" style="s2">they can&#39;t blame Black Ridge for my choices. I&#39;m <br />not staying anywhere. If you&#39;re on that bridge,  </p>
<p begin="00:33:16.960" end="00:33:27.360" style="s2">then stand far enough away that only I burn. No <br />weapons, no escorts. I brought what you wanted.  </p>
<p begin="00:33:27.360" end="00:33:51.520" style="s2">And you brought yourself. Efficient. <br />You get a shroud. I get him and them.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.280" end="00:35:17.520" style="s2">Old chapel, old lies. You really hate walking <br />into places alone. If you&#39;re here to drag me back,  </p>
<p begin="00:35:17.520" end="00:35:22.640" style="s2">try harder. Mera&#39;s blessing file <br />names this chapel as original moon  </p>
<p begin="00:36:17.840" end="00:36:21.680" style="s2">Queen&#39;s daughter. You think that&#39;s coincidence?  </p>
<p begin="00:36:22.880" end="00:36:28.720" style="s2">My father&#39;s notes talked about a lost heir. <br />I never had a name. You guessed it was me and  </p>
<p begin="00:36:28.720" end="00:36:34.160" style="s2">stayed quiet. I guessed. I didn&#39;t know. Guessing <br />out loud paints a target that never comes off. We  </p>
<p begin="00:36:34.160" end="00:36:39.840" style="s2">can argue motives later. Meera&#39;s fake blessing <br />is happening now. If this shows anything,  </p>
<p begin="00:36:39.840" end="00:36:50.800" style="s2">we use it. If it kills me, at least it&#39;s <br />honest. You don&#39;t owe any of them this.</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.800" end="00:37:00.640" style="s2">Serena, take her. They&#39;re coming for the <br />bloodline. The council. Malik already sold us for  </p>
<p begin="00:37:00.640" end="00:37:09.040" style="s2">a council seat. Live far enough that they forget <br />your crown. She called me Moonville. You were  </p>
<p begin="00:37:09.040" end="00:37:18.800" style="s2">never lost. You were hidden. You&#39;re the queen&#39;s. <br />Serena Moonvil, the girl they buried on paper.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.800" end="00:37:26.640" style="s2">Only the queen&#39;s daughter may wake the moon.</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.640" end="00:37:32.880" style="s2">He killed you for something he will never <br />wear. We have what he fears most. Truth  </p>
<p begin="00:37:32.880" end="00:37:37.840" style="s2">and a name. I&#39;ll take Silver Creek warriors <br />inside. They still answer to my voice for  </p>
<p begin="00:37:37.840" end="00:37:44.560" style="s2">now. Black Ridge holds the exits. If <br />they turn on you, they meet us first.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.560" end="00:37:52.000" style="s2">No one carries this because of me. We&#39;re <br />ending what Malik started. The moon chooses  </p>
<p begin="00:37:52.000" end="00:38:04.080" style="s2">its air. Bless Luna. Witness the new order. <br />You&#39;re kneeling to stolen blood. Gods. The  </p>
<p begin="00:38:04.080" end="00:38:15.760" style="s2">moon already chose. You erased her. This is <br />her truth. She attacks wherever she goes.  </p>
<p begin="00:38:17.440" end="00:38:27.440" style="s2">Let go of me. Fall back. Live to fight with proof. <br />You cut your own evidence. Why? Under wartime law,  </p>
<p begin="00:38:27.440" end="00:38:34.640" style="s2">questioning the council mid judgment strips an <br />alpha of command. Serena, run. Adrien Black,  </p>
<p begin="00:38:34.640" end="00:38:44.480" style="s2">your command is suspended until this witch <br />is judged. Run, Serena. Rise for your Luna.  </p>
<p begin="00:38:44.480" end="00:38:52.320" style="s2">I&#39;ve waited for all of you to say who I am. Take <br />the witch below until we decide her fate. On your  </p>
<p begin="00:38:52.320" end="00:39:01.040" style="s2">knees. You&#39;ll go through me first. Alpha or <br />not, you&#39;re still ours. 10 seconds is enough.  </p>
<p begin="00:39:01.040" end="00:39:12.480" style="s2">Her boots pounds down the side stairs. Not out. <br />Down. Another guard. You ignored my last order.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.720" end="00:39:36.000" style="s2">They built these for you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.640" end="00:40:15.360" style="s2">Then I start with listening. They said <br />my son would live if I confessed alone.</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.920" end="00:40:29.520" style="s2">Questioning Malik was the only crime. The crest <br />on the chest was royal. He said it was scrap.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.520" end="00:40:34.160" style="s2">We followed him, not the council. You&#39;re <br />late again. Some Silver Creek warriors  </p>
<p begin="00:40:34.160" end="00:40:42.480" style="s2">will protect civilians if it comes to a <br />fight. Then let me stand where I failed.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.480" end="00:40:49.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t stand for me. Stand for them. Your job is <br />to make sure they get home alive. Orders accepted.  </p>
<p begin="00:40:49.600" end="00:40:58.720" style="s2">You wanted records? We copied what we could <br />before they burnt the blocks. Bodies they hid.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.720" end="00:41:02.320" style="s2">Crown vault.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.320" end="00:41:08.960" style="s2">Malik keeps the dead in the crown vault. <br />Records and bodies. We take the ones that  </p>
<p begin="00:41:08.960" end="00:41:18.080" style="s2">can still speak. Search the east wing. <br />I want every vault checked. Why tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.080" end="00:41:23.600" style="s2">Move when they argue, not when they order. They <br />called us traitors before we even spoke. They  </p>
<p begin="00:41:23.600" end="00:41:28.480" style="s2">didn&#39;t even bother with person. This is <br />where they buried my wolf. Witness cells.  </p>
<p begin="00:41:28.480" end="00:41:36.560" style="s2">Deep side. We take the records first, then <br />the people. The council knew you&#39;d come.  </p>
<p begin="00:41:36.560" end="00:41:48.160" style="s2">No. Paper burns. Witnesses don&#39;t. Then we get <br />the ones they haven&#39;t silenced yet. Keys now.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.160" end="00:41:56.480" style="s2">Another trial. Not for you. For them.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.480" end="00:42:02.720" style="s2">Breaking into a crown vault. Now keep <br />the crown. I want the truth. Truth is  </p>
<p begin="00:42:02.720" end="00:42:09.920" style="s2">whatever survives and witnesses is <br />whatever survives record witnesses.  </p>
<p begin="00:42:10.480" end="00:42:19.360" style="s2">Kill the witnesses first. You want <br />war, aim higher than the unarmed.</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.360" end="00:42:25.680" style="s2">Stay down when the moon speaks. Real blood <br />doesn&#39;t scream like that. I took what they  </p>
<p begin="00:42:25.680" end="00:42:34.640" style="s2">offered. I earned this. You weren&#39;t chosen. You <br />were loaded. Loaded is better than invisible.  </p>
<p begin="00:42:34.640" end="00:42:49.040" style="s2">Get them out. Move this way. They will ruin <br />everything we built. You built it on our bones.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.040" end="00:42:54.640" style="s2">Then let&#39;s see what&#39;s really powering you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.640" end="00:43:06.320" style="s2">That&#39;s councilbinding magic. No, keep <br />your eyes down. If I stay, I burn alone.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.320" end="00:43:11.440" style="s2">or you walk up there and <br />prove what they did to you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.440" end="00:43:17.280" style="s2">We have witnesses. We move.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.280" end="00:43:24.000" style="s2">If I fall, she burns with me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.000" end="00:43:33.600" style="s2">The traitor. Well, let the moon see its new face.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.600" end="00:43:35.280" style="s2">I am ready, elders.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.040" end="00:43:54.400" style="s2">If you want a show, watch this one. Use it. Let <br />them watch. The moon already chose. Then prove  </p>
<p begin="00:43:54.400" end="00:44:04.320" style="s2">it on someone who isn&#39;t chained or paid. She used <br />council bindings, not blessing. Enough, Theatrics.  </p>
<p begin="00:44:05.040" end="00:44:14.320" style="s2">Behold the thief of forbidden relics. You <br />gave it to me. She stole and misused holy  </p>
<p begin="00:44:14.320" end="00:44:24.240" style="s2">shards to mimic the moon. So the <br />blessing is false. You promised.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.240" end="00:44:31.280" style="s2">A broken tool still cuts once. <br />They&#39;re releasing the damned.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.040" end="00:44:40.720" style="s2">Behold what her rebellion unleashed. <br />The witch calls the damned against us.</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.720" end="00:44:45.440" style="s2">Cut down every rebel.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.440" end="00:44:50.960" style="s2">Stand down. Council orders. Protect <br />them. That&#39;s an order. We guard our pack,  </p>
<p begin="00:44:50.960" end="00:44:59.920" style="s2">not their lies. I believe Mik. I believe Meera. <br />I exiled the one the moon chose. That ends now.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.920" end="00:45:04.160" style="s2">Right here. Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.160" end="00:45:15.520" style="s2">She&#39;s covering us. I judged wrong. Follow <br />the light. Don&#39;t stop for anything.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.520" end="00:45:22.080" style="s2">You picked the wrong Alpha to chain. The alpha.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.080" end="00:45:30.080" style="s2">You want someone your size? Try <br />me. Go. Take what was yours.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.600" end="00:45:42.160" style="s2">No more witnesses between us. She&#39;s going <br />for him. No more witnesses. Face me. Look  </p>
<p begin="00:45:42.160" end="00:45:48.480" style="s2">at you. No counsel, no alpha, no <br />crown. I spent my life believing  </p>
<p begin="00:45:48.480" end="00:45:54.800" style="s2">those things made me real. Turns out the <br />ones you tried to erase stand behind me.  </p>
<p begin="00:45:54.800" end="00:46:07.120" style="s2">That&#39;s my crown. Crowds are pickled. <br />Fear lasts longer. No one crowned you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.120" end="00:46:15.680" style="s2">Then watch me rise. What is she doing? <br />I see them. You are not his monsters.  </p>
<p begin="00:46:15.680" end="00:46:26.240" style="s2">You&#39;re what he buried. We remember he killed <br />the crown. Destroy the stone. Cut the feed.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.880" end="00:46:38.640" style="s2">You used their pain as a niche.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.640" end="00:46:48.000" style="s2">Now they know who held the chain. Malik,</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.000" end="00:46:51.440" style="s2">they are ravid. This proves nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.120" end="00:47:01.840" style="s2">They remember every order you <br />gave for every queen you betrayed.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.840" end="00:47:06.960" style="s2">The council mark is gone. He faces <br />every pack he used alive for as long  </p>
<p begin="00:47:06.960" end="00:47:11.520" style="s2">as justice takes. The people you helped <br />break never got hit. Mirrorstone will  </p>
<p begin="00:47:11.520" end="00:47:18.080" style="s2">stand at every hearing. Every <br />name she touched, she speaks.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
